# An unblocked Memnite gains its controller one life on acceptance and deals no combat damage; it deals damage on a later turn (CR 509.1h, 118.12, 611.2a).
[Bot1 Deck]
Delif's Cone
Memnite
Ornithopter
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Delif's Cone.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Delif's Cone.Activate(Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite)
? Bot1.Graveyard = Delif's Cone
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Memnite > Bot2; Ornithopter > Bot2)
Bot1.Accept
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Life = 21
? Bot2.Life = 20
[T5 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Memnite > Bot2)
[T5 Bot1.Main2]
[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 21
Bot2.Life = 19
